`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"In Episode 1 of The Underdog Show, Danii and I talk about how he got his first customers, his restaurant business, reaching around one million users with his game, the exit, crypto, losing money, alcohol, Russia, working as a barista, his current apps, and what keeps him building after everything that happened."}),`
