`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"At 26, Pasha has already changed directions more times than many people are willing to do in their entire careers."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"But there is one part of his story that caught my attention."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"At one point, he had the opportunity to become a main photographer for Forbes in Slovakia."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"He said no."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Not because photography had failed him."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Actually, it was going pretty well."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"He had photographed successful business people and millionaires. He had built experience, clients and a career around his creative skills."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"But meeting those successful people made him start asking himself a completely different question:"}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:u.jsx(c.strong,{children:'"Are these people actually smarter than me?"'})}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"That question eventually changed the direction of his life."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Today, Pasha works as a senior UX designer, spends time with his family, still does photography and then, often at night, opens his laptop and works on his own SaaS product."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"There is another interesting detail."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:u.jsx(c.strong,{children:"He comes from a non technical background."})}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"So why would someone who spent years building a creative career suddenly decide to learn coding and become an indie hacker?"}),`
`,u.jsxs(c.p,{children:["That's what we explored in Episode 2 of ",u.jsx(c.strong,{children:"The Underdog Show"}),"."]}),`
`,u.jsx(c.h2,{children:"It Started With Art, Not Code"}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Pasha didn't grow up thinking he would become a software developer."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"He loved creative work."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Painting interested him."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Then came graphic design."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"He taught himself Photoshop and started creating banners and other designs."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Eventually, his interest moved toward photography."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"He loved the artistic side of it, but there was a problem."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Making stable money from photography wasn't easy."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"His then fiancée, now his wife, suggested that he find stable work."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"So Pasha did something that would later become a pattern throughout his life."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"He didn't completely abandon one thing for another."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"He did both."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"He worked a regular job in graphic design while continuing photography on the side."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Then graphic design introduced him to something new."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:u.jsx(c.strong,{children:"UX and UI design."})}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"This was different."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"It wasn't only about making something beautiful anymore."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"It was about understanding how people interact with what you create."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Pasha became fascinated with the idea that someone could actually touch, use and experience something he designed."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"He started learning."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Junior designer became mid level designer."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Eventually, he became a senior UX designer."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"But at the same time, something interesting was happening with his photography career."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.h2,{children:"Photographing Millionaires Changed How He Thought About Money"}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Pasha chose business portraits as his photography niche."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"That decision eventually gave him opportunities to photograph people for Forbes Slovakia."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Suddenly, he was meeting people with businesses and significant wealth."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"He could talk to them."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Observe them."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Understand how they thought."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"And he started wondering:"}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:u.jsx(c.strong,{children:"Why are they financially successful?"})}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Was it because they were dramatically smarter than everyone else?"}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"His conclusion was different."}),`
`,u.jsxs(c.p,{children:["It was often about the ",u.jsx(c.strong,{children:"business model"}),"."]}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"That realization exposed a limitation in his own photography business."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"If Pasha wanted to earn more from photography, he generally had to work more."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"More clients meant more shoots."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"More shoots meant more travel."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Then came editing."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"His income remained closely connected to the number of hours he personally worked."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"So another question appeared:"}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:u.jsx(c.strong,{children:"Could I build something where my income isn't directly tied to every hour I work?"})}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"That question slowly pushed him toward software."}),`
