`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"In late 2025, one of Pasha's previous photography clients approached him about joining a startup."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"The idea was to build a dating application and eventually raise venture capital."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Pasha contributed his UX expertise and spent months working with the team."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"But the funding they expected kept getting delayed."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Promises of raising money continued."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"That experience pushed Pasha to research the startup world himself."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"And he discovered something he hadn't really understood before."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"You didn't necessarily need to raise millions from investors to build a company."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"There were people on the internet building small software products themselves."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"They were launching them."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Getting customers."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Making money."}),`
