`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"And this time, he chose a problem he understood much better."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.h2,{children:"Building Honey Traffic"}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"Pasha had spent years maintaining his photography website."}),`
`,u.jsx(c.p,{children:"And like almost every person trying to grow a website, he eventually ran into SEO."}),`
